## Road placement validation (cb_network::validation)
road-invalid-too-steep = Too steep
road-invalid-too-sharp = Curve too tight
road-invalid-too-short = Too short
road-invalid-overlap = Overlaps another road
road-invalid-water-no-bridge = Crosses water (bridges are not available yet)
road-invalid-crossing-clearance = Crossing height doesn't fit: make a junction or an overpass
road-invalid-out-of-bounds = Outside the map
road-invalid-junction-angle = Roads meet at too sharp an angle
road-invalid-junction-too-close = Too close to another junction
road-invalid-junction-shape = The junction can't be shaped here
road-invalid-junction-degree = Too many roads at one junction
road-invalid-junction-connector = Turns here would be too tight for vehicles
road-invalid-overpass-unavailable = Overpasses are not available yet: cross at street level
road-invalid-target-missing = The road to connect to no longer exists
plot-invalid-frontage = A plot needs at least 8 m along a road
plot-invalid-corner = Plots can only continue around a junction corner
plot-invalid-overlap = No free land here
plot-invalid-size = Plot size must be between 100 m² and 4 ha
plot-invalid-missing = The plot no longer exists
money-insufficient = Not enough money
internal-id-space = Too many objects
internal-no-catalog = Game data is missing
internal-no-result = The action could not be completed
